<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Undead Door</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Necromancer (guild level 25)
Mana: 50
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast undead door &lt;undead&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster utters 'Muera piort', and trades places with an undead 
creature anywhere in the world: you appear where it was, and it appears 
where you stood. A way to travel far, if you know where a zombie, a 
skeleton or a ghost is lingering.
</p><p>It works only on the undead, and the undead resists: some, like a 
skeletal champion or a vampire, are harder to switch with than a zombie. 
Both you and the undead must be in places that allow teleporting. And 
beware the rift: about one cast in twenty tears a hole in the powers of 
magic instead, and you may be flung somewhere unknown, or something may 
come through at you.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
